sequenceDiagram
  actor V as Visitor
  participant Card as Card (TemplateCard)
  participant Store as Popups store
  participant Host as PopupHost / PopupAnswer
  participant Relay as Feedback channel
  participant API as Client's API

  V->>Card: "Choose this package"
  Card->>Store: show("popup-order", "The same, with the AI assistant")
  Store-->>Host: open[id] = true, context[id]
  Host-->>V: frame from the look, a chip with the package, the fields
  V->>Host: "Send the request"
  Host->>Host: check the required fields
  alt something is missing
    Host-->>V: red outline, "Please fill in the marked fields"
  else all there
    Host->>Relay: POST feedback.endpoint ("popup-order" — package, fields)
    Relay-->>Host: ok
    Host-->>V: "Thank you!" and a "Close" button
  end
  Note over Store,API: A dialog popup (confirm, choice, date) instead of a form<br/>returns its value to whoever called show() and,<br/>if deliver is set, sends it to the client's API
  Store-)API: POST endpoint.url { source, id, kind, value, locale, page, at }
